      "description": "Lake of the Ozark's go-to boating map and lake guide app.\n\nExplore Lake of the Ozarks with confidence. Discover marinas, boat launches, waterfront restaurants, fuel docks, hangout spots, and more. Save your favorite places, record your time on the water, and share your adventures with friends and family.\n\nWhether you're new to the lake or out every weekend, Float LOZ helps you learn your way around and make the most of your day on the water.\n\nFavorites\nSave marinas, restaurants, boat launches, and other go-to spots for quick access anytime.\n\nPlaces\nCreate your own custom places on the map. Mark quiet coves, surfing areas, fishing spots, sandbars, or favorite hangouts and keep them organized your way.\n\nLocate Yourself Instantly\nQuickly see your location on the lake and orient yourself with ease.\n\nCurrent\nStay updated with lake news, water level, water temperature, and weather forecasts.\n\nChoose Your Map Style\nSwitch between multiple map styles including standard, satellite, and dark mode views.\n\nMap Overlays\nToggle overlays for fuel docks, boat launches, markers, and other useful lake information.\n\nFloat+ Features\n\nTracks\nRecord your day on the water and save your path to revisit later.\n\nLive Sessions\nShare your live location with friends and family using a simple link or code.\n\n3D Map Mode\nView the lake in perspective with terrain and depth for a more immersive experience on the water.\n\nFloat LOZ is designed to help you explore and enjoy Lake of the Ozarks, not provide turn-by-turn marine navigation. Always operate responsibly and use proper marine charts and equipment when boating.\n\nTerms of Use - https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
